<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves up FIM 33 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves up FIM 33 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to November 29 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to November 22 SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,985	 36,951</p>
<p> Money market intervention     7,041	 10,461</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,987	  5,985</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,271	  2,271</p>
<p> Total assets		     60,989	 64,420</p>
<p>In the previous week, to November 22, reserves fell by 589</p>
<p>million markka.    --Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
